      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are feeling incredibly vulnerable, questioning the very premise of trying to \"fix\" yourself. Many people feel this way when they've been hurt, believing that changing anything will just lead back to pain. Instead of viewing yourself as a broken machine, perhaps you can see yourself as someone who has been deeply wounded and is now surviving in a way that feels necessary. Your struggle isn't a personal failure; it's the result of overwhelming experience.",
      "source": "target",
